      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "Just a heads-up:  We made the BPE training 20x faster on the head, even though this isn't due to parallel processing. We\u2019ll be highlighting this performance gain in the v0.2.2 release notes.",
      "created_at": "2026-06-15T15:55:52Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/issues/366#issuecomment-4709770268",
      "id": 4709770268,
